    "# Interactive LAS File and Visualization Parameter Selection\n",
    "\n",
    "This section adds interactive widgets for selecting LAS files and adjusting visualization parameters. You can dynamically explore different files and customize the display (colormap, point size, HAG range, etc.) for both 2D and 3D visualizations. Inspired by [pdemtools/strip_search.ipynb](https://github.com/trchudley/pdemtools/blob/main/notebooks/strip_search.ipynb) and [RIS_basement_sediment](https://github.com/mdtanker/RIS_basement_sediment).\n",
