    "**Instructions:**\n",
    "- Use the dropdown to select a LAS file from your input directory.\n",
    "- Adjust the point size, colormap, and HAG (Z_norm) range as needed.\n",
    "- Toggle between CSF, SMRF, and original/normalized views.\n",
    "- Click the button to update the visualization.\n",
    "\n",
    "> *Requires: `ipywidgets`, `matplotlib`, `laspy`, and `pyvista` (for 3D). Install with `pip install ipywidgets matplotlib laspy pyvista` if needed.*"
